sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant AuthorService
    participant Author
    participant JPA
    participant PostgreSQL

    Client->>AuthorResource: PUT /authors/{id} with Author body
    activate AuthorResource
    
    AuthorResource->>Author: setId(id)
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    Note right of AuthorResource: Set ID from path variable
    
    AuthorResource->>AuthorService: update(author)
    activate AuthorService
    
    AuthorService->>JPA: find(Author.class, id)
    activate JPA
    Note right of AuthorService: Retrieve Author from persistence context
    
    JPA->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM author WHERE id = ?
    activate PostgreSQL
    
    PostgreSQL-->>JPA: return author row
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    
    JPA->>Author: instantiate Author
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    
    AuthorService->>Author: setName(newName), setEmail(newEmail)
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    Note right of AuthorService: Modify name or email properties
    
    JPA->>Author: detect changes via dirty checking
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    Note right of JPA: JPA detects changes via dirty checking
    
    AuthorService->>JPA: flush()
    Note right of AuthorService: Flush changes to PostgreSQL database
    
    JPA->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE author SET name = ?, email = ? WHERE id = ?
    activate PostgreSQL
    
    PostgreSQL-->>JPA: return update count
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    deactivate JPA
    
    AuthorService-->>AuthorResource: return void
    deactivate AuthorService
    
    AuthorResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.noContent().build()
    deactivate AuthorResource
    Note right of AuthorResource: HTTP 204 No Content

    alt Author not found
        JPA->>PostgreSQL: SELECT returns empty result
        activate PostgreSQL
        deactivate PostgreSQL
        
        AuthorService->>AuthorService: throw ObjectNotFoundException
        
        AuthorService-->>Client: ResponseEntity with 404 Not Found
        Note right of AuthorService: Author not found error
    end